    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d431">

                <pb facs="0445" n="347" sameAs="frus:frus1900/pg347"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Choate to Mr.
                            Hay.</hi></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >American Embassy</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                            >London</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian" when="1900-08-11"
                                ><hi rendition="#italic">August 11, 1900</hi></date>.</dateline>
                    <seg rendition="#float-left">No. 381.]</seg></opener>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Sir</hi>: I have the honor to report that upon the
                    receipt of your instruction by cable, of August 8,<anchor n="1" xml:id="d431-f1"
                    /> I communicated the contents thereof to Her Majesty’s minister for foreign
                    affairs by a note of August 9.</p>
                <p>I have the honor to be, etc.,</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Joseph H. Choate.</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
